# ContactOut

> ContactOut is a B2B email finder and professional contact data platform. It provides verified personal and work emails, phone numbers, and enriched people and company profiles for 350M professionals across 40M companies, via Chrome extension, search portal, bulk tools, and API. Used by recruiters and sales teams, including 75% of Fortune 500 companies. GDPR and CCPA compliant; for professional B2B use only.

